  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine the chicken broth, vegetable broth, water, chicken, cannellini beans, potatoes, pepper, salt, oregano, and garlic powder in a large pot; bring to a boil; reduce heat to medium-high and cook until the potatoes are fork-tender, about 15 minutes. Add the kale and cook another 5 minutes; serve.",
